│                          │ smallest triangle, which is directly detrimental to the evaluated score. This edit first  │
│                          │ maximizes the exact candidate minimum area, then uses the soft bottleneck only to break   │
│                          │ numerically meaningful near-ties. This retains the useful global-shaping behavior of the  │
│                          │ smooth surrogate without permitting it to trade away the hard bottleneck.                 │
