│                          │ hull also aligns with the common three-fold structure of strong triangle-packing          │
│                          │ configurations. Candidate points are projected into this hull, keeping its area fixed and │
│                          │ making raw minimum-area optimization equivalent to normalized optimization. Additional    │
│                          │ deterministic restarts compensate for the changed, less grid-like search landscape.       │
