│ patch_description        │ Change the fixed containing hull from a triangle to the unit square and initialize the    │
│                          │ nine free points from a perturbed 3-by-3 lattice. The square supplies four well-separated │
│                          │ hull vertices and has fixed area one, while the lattice initialization avoids the         │
│                          │ frequent nearly-collinear triples produced by uniform random starts. The existing         │
│                          │ determinant objective remains suitable because maximizing double-area is equivalent to    │
│                          │ maximizing area under a fixed hull. Projection is changed to square clipping, and all     │
│                          │ free-point indexing is updated for the four fixed corners.                                │
