│                          │ Additional directions repel the point from its nearest neighbors, helping resolve         │
│                          │ clustered low-area triples.  Random directions are retained for escaping                  │
│                          │ competing-constraint local traps.  This makes the same proposal budget substantially more │
│                          │ aligned with the determinant-area objective, especially in late-stage refinement.         │
