│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ plateau_aware_polish                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the final coordinate polishing stage with a plateau-aware hard max-min            │
│                          │ refinement. The previous polish selected only the largest immediate minimum area, so when │
│                          │ many proposals tied at the current bottleneck it almost always retained proposal zero     │
│                          │ (the current point), preventing motion along the common flat faces of the nonsmooth       │
│                          │ Heilbronn objective.                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new refinement uses denser, phase-rotated radial proposals and permits only moves     │
│                          │ that do not reduce the strict current minimum. Among those feasible plateau moves, it     │
│                          │ selects the configuration with the strongest lower tail (sum of the 18 smallest triangle  │
│                          │ areas). This is a deterministic lexicographic-style refinement: preserve the actual       │
│                          │ evaluated objective first, then improve near-active constraints so later moves can raise  │
│                          │ the bottleneck. Rotating the proposal stencil by an irrational phase avoids repeatedly    │
│                          │ searching only the same coordinate directions.                                            │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0300                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
