╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ island_de13                                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ This replaces sequential strict coordinate hill-climbing with a deterministic             │
│                          │ island-based differential-evolution search. The prior programs showed that multiple       │
│                          │ starting geometries are valuable, but their coordinate updates could not cross valleys    │
│                          │ where a temporary decrease in the smallest triangle is needed. The new approach evolves   │
│                          │ complete 13-point configurations simultaneously, using several structured and randomized  │
│                          │ populations, periodic migration, lower-tail selection early in the run, and strict        │
│                          │ minimum-area selection late in the run.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The square corners remain fixed, giving an exactly unit-area convex hull. Full-population │
│                          │ vectorized triangle evaluation makes global exploration substantially cheaper than        │
│                          │ repeatedly constructing proposal arrays for one coordinate at a time. A final             │
│                          │ deterministic directional polish recovers local max-min improvements from the best        │
│                          │ evolved configuration.                                                                    │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
