│ patch_name               │ square_bundle13                                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover retains the unit-square hull and fixed corners from the current program,   │
│                          │ preserving an exactly unit convex-hull area and the original function interface. It       │
│                          │ incorporates the stronger inspiration program’s bundle-style coordinate search, exact     │
│                          │ bottleneck-gradient proposals, batched incident-triangle evaluation, soft lower-tail      │
│                          │ tie-breaking, and targeted joint moves for tight triangles.                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The implementation is more efficient than repeatedly recomputing all triangle             │
│                          │ determinants for every single proposal: coordinate proposals update only triangles        │
│                          │ incident to the moved point. Full batch evaluation is used only for occasional two-point  │
│                          │ escape moves. Fixed seeding and a defensive fallback preserve deterministic, reproducible │
│                          │ behavior.                                                                                 │
