│                          │ symmetry-broken high/low-row pattern. Each is lightly jittered and projected into the     │
│                          │ same fixed equilateral hull, preserving validity, determinism, and computational cost     │
│                          │ while improving the chance that the coordinate search reaches a stronger active-triangle  │
│                          │ combinatorial structure.                                                                  │
